        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the calendar year in which this Contract expires, the parties agree to exchange proposals for a successor Contract by March 15 and to enter into negotiations in accordance with the procedures set forth herein and as found in Chapter 447 of the Florida Statutes by April 1, or at a mutually agreed upon time. The total Contract negotiated shall be reduced to writing and signed by the Board and the Association.",
            "block_bbox": [
                81,
