        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. If the negotiations described in this section reach impasse, the procedures as set forth in the Florida Statutes and/or the rules of the Public Employees Relations Commission shall be followed. At the request of either party, a mediator shall be appointed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                60,
                254,
